The files in this directory (fixedint.h, fe.h, fe.c, ge.h, ge.c, sc.h, sc.c,
precomp_data.h) are the ref10 Ed25519 implementation from:

    https://github.com/orlp/ed25519
    Copyright (c) 2015 Orson Peters <orsonpeters@gmail.com>
    zlib license (see below)

They are vendored unmodified. They provide the Ed25519 field/group/scalar
arithmetic that adbwire's SPAKE2 implementation (../spake2.c) needs to
interoperate with Android's Wireless Debugging pairing, which uses
BoringSSL's SPAKE2-over-Ed25519 (crypto/curve25519/spake25519.cc).

